#: ../../source/Crypto/Crypto.rst:59 30ea804b8270411f8793908bdc7a2a97
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The library is built as a shared object (``libcrypto_api.so``) so it can "
"be loaded from Python: ``PyFlow/network_api/rsa_crypto.py`` is a ctypes "
"binding used by the TCP layer. It exposes the RSA-OAEP message encryption"
" and the ECDH/AES-256-GCM sealing (``EcdhKeyPair`` / ``EcdhPubKey`` / "
"``hkdf_sha256``) that the framed TCP channel uses for its bulk and file "
"transfer payloads (see the ``TCP_Server_APIs`` / ``TCP_Client_APIs`` "
"encrypted channel sections). The binding also implements the TCP layer's "
"anti-MITM identity check (TOFU): endpoint rejects the connection; a key "
"already known under another endpoint is accepted and re-registered under "
"the new one. The encryption state machine is bounded: three consecutive "
"decode failures trip a circuit breaker (``MAX_DECODE_FAILURES`` in "
"``connect_tcp.py``) that stops re-keying, and a key that is stale or "
"rotated makes the TCP layer reload its own key and re-exchange. The "
"binding looks for the library via ``ctypes.util.find_library`` and then "
"next to the repository root in ``build/`` (``libcrypto_api.so``, "
"``libcrypto_api.dylib``, ``libcrypto_api.dll`` and "
"``build/Release/crypto_api.dll``)."
msgstr ""
"该库被构建为共享对象（“libcrypto_api.so”），因此可以从Python加载：“src/network_api/rsa_crypto.py”是TCP层使用的ctypes绑定"
"，用于使用RSA-OAEP加密消息（请参阅“TCP_Server_APIs”/“TCP_Client_APIs”加密通道部分）。该绑定还实现了 "
"TCP 层的反 MITM 身份检查 (TOFU)：在每个连接上交换对等公钥，并使用其 SHA-256 "
"记录在“network_api/.Flow/pub_key/pub_key.json”中对等方的“(ip, "
"port)”下，并且记录端点的更改密钥会拒绝连接。绑定通过“ctypes.util.find_library”和存储库根目录旁边的“build/”查找库。"

#: ../../source/Crypto/Crypto.rst:77 9594680fce33464f9ff9cb9590bb5d0a
msgid ""
"The build produces the SOVERSIONed names ``libcrypto_api.so.1`` / "
"``libcrypto_api.so.1.0.0`` plus the ``libcrypto_api.so`` loader symlink."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/Crypto/Crypto.rst:80 80c24657a4c9445088459fff264379b2
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"CMake install rules export the ``crypto_api`` library, its public "
"headers, and a CMake package configuration. All CMake content sits at the"
" repository root: the CMake package template and the pkg-config template "
"are ``cmake/crypto_apiConfig.cmake.in`` and ``crypto_api.pc.in``. "
"Consumers use the CMake target ``crypto_api::crypto_api`` (or "
"``find_package(crypto_api)``, ``SameMajorVersion`` compatible), or pkg-"
"config module ``crypto_api`` (``-lcrypto_api`` for linking, ``-lcrypto`` "
"as a private dependency)."
msgstr ""
"CMake 安装规则导出“crypto_api”库、其公共标头和 CMake 包配置。所有 CMake 内容都位于存储库根目录：CMake "
"包模板和 pkg-config 模板是“cmake/crypto_apiConfig.cmake.in”和“crypto_api.pc.in”。"

#: ../../source/Crypto/Crypto.rst:89 dccd3901c8024859b9a9753e818d6692
msgid "Common API"
msgstr "通用API"

#: ../../source/Crypto/Crypto.rst:91 c1b71e19c8f6422eabd99bd0997daae8
msgid ""
"Most public functions return ``pf_err_t``; ``PF_OK`` indicates success. "
"Functions that report a size or a string instead have their own return "
"type (``pf_err_string`` returns ``const char *``, "
"``pf_crypto_openssl_errors`` returns ``void``, ``pf_rsa_ciphertext_len`` "
"and ``pf_rsa_max_plaintext_len`` return ``size_t``, and the ``*_free`` "
"functions return ``void``). Use ``pf_err_string`` to convert an error "
"code to readable text and ``pf_crypto_openssl_errors`` to retrieve the "
"pending OpenSSL error queue."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/Crypto/Crypto.rst:114 67ae5556635e43a487c38bf8011e1c5b
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The library uses caller-provided output buffers for fixed-size results. "
"Functions that return allocated buffers document that the caller must "
"release them with ``pf_crypto_free`` — the library's own ``free``, so the"
" allocation and the deallocation always run on the same C runtime (a host"
" such as CPython on Windows may use a different one, and freeing across "
"runtimes corrupts the heap). Opaque key handles must be released with "
"their corresponding ``*_free`` function. HKDF output is capped at "
"``PF_CRYPTO_HKDF_SHA256_MAX_OUT`` (8160 bytes) by both "
"``pf_crypto_hkdf_sha256`` and ``pf_ecdh_derive_key``."
msgstr "该库使用调用者提供的输出缓冲区来获取固定大小的结果。返回分配的缓冲区的函数记录了调用者必须使用“free”释放它们。不透明的按键句柄必须使用其相应的“*_free”函数来释放。"

#: ../../source/Crypto/Crypto.rst:125 69248ac47e7e47f18e953dee857db239
msgid "RSA API"
msgstr "RSA API"

#: ../../source/Crypto/Crypto.rst:127 a770dcc04e2c42d1be50fe30d298df4b
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"RSA keys are generated with ``pf_rsa_keygen``. The implementation uses "
"RSA-OAEP with SHA-256 for encryption and decryption. Key sizes from 2048 "
"to 16384 bits are accepted; 2048, 3072, or 4096 bits are recommended."
msgstr ""
"RSA 密钥是使用“ss_rsa_keygen”生成的。该实现使用 RSA-OAEP 和 SHA-256 进行加密和解密。接受 2048 至 "
"16384 位的密钥大小；建议使用 2048、3072 或 4096 位。"

#: ../../source/Crypto/Crypto.rst:151 e7b876b8fb354b2da45d3c13f50ededf
msgid ""
"The first encryption call with ``out == NULL`` queries the required "
"output size; ``pf_rsa_decrypt`` supports the same query pattern. RSA "
"encryption is binary-safe (it accepts an explicit input length, embedded "
"NUL bytes included) and rejects inputs longer than the value returned by "
"``pf_rsa_max_plaintext_len`` with ``PF_ERR_INVALID_ARG``. "
"``pf_rsa_ciphertext_len`` returns the ciphertext size for a key (equal to"
" its modulus size in bytes), and ``pf_rsa_key_free`` releases a key "
"handle."
msgstr ""

